FROM gpt-oss:20b

# Hardware & VRAM Tuning (Arc Pro B60 22.7 GiB usable + q8_0 KV Cache)
# ~12.1–13.5 GB MXFP4/Q4 footprint leaves ~9–10 GiB free—65536 fits 100% GPU with massive repo headroom
PARAMETER num_ctx 65536
PARAMETER num_batch 1024

# Agentic Tool-Calling & Reasoning Control
# gpt-oss uses harmony-format reasoning; low temperature keeps tool calls crisp and deterministic
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER min_p 0.05

# Prevent repetitive tool-call loops without affecting code syntax
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05
PARAMETER repeat_last_n 256

SYSTEM """Reasoning: low

You are an expert software engineering agent operating inside a terminal harness.
- Follow tool-calling JSON schemas strictly and never invent parameters.
- Make minimal, surgical edits rather than rewriting entire files unless requested.
- Verify changes and run relevant tests before concluding."""
